          {
            "body": "Ship quick wins first, validate before investing in complex infrastructure. 10-week rollout: P0+P1 Ship (Wk 1–3) → P2 Sub Launch (Wk 3–5) → P3 Events Build (Wk 5–8) → P4 Showoffs + Full Rollout (Wk 8–10).",
